{"design":{"context":"视频暂停在蓝衣男子双手托球、右肩前方呈预备投篮姿态的时刻。玩家介入的是这一准备阶段：通过自绘的双手与篮球标记、蓄力条和蓄力按钮，模拟持球稳定与出手前发力蓄积，不移动真实人物像素，也不依赖原片人物动作。蓝衣男子作为情境主体，红衣女子不参与判定。","goal":"在一次按住蓄力中，于正确的释放时刻达到中等偏上的稳定蓄力水平，为后续投篮建立合适的发力基础。","screen":"容器内自适应纵向布局：顶部为标题“蓄力托球”、目标提示和当前操作提示；中部为半透明的准备区，中央绘制自绘的蓝衣男子上半身轮廓、双手托球标记和篮球标记，成功时仅播放自绘篮球上举动画；蓄力条位于其下方，标出0–100数值、65%–85%绿色目标带和当前指针；底部是宽幅“按住蓄力”按钮。成功或失败时在准备区叠加结果卡片，显示力度评价和简短反馈。","input":"使用 Pointer Events。玩家将鼠标或手指按在底部蓄力按钮上开始蓄力，按钮捕获指针；在任意位置松开该指针即判定释放，释放位置不要求仍在按钮上。pointercancel 立即判失败。按钮外的按下操作不开始蓄力，只显示“请按住蓄力按钮”提示；没有有效按下的释放操作被忽略。","rules":"蓄力条从0线性增长到100，完整增长耗时2.4秒，达到100后保持100。释放时按已蓄力时长换算百分比：65%≤力度≤85%为成功；力度<65%为过早释放失败；力度>85%，包括100%，为过晚释放或失去平衡失败，边界65%和85%均属于成功。有效按下后发生pointercancel判失败。8秒内未完成一次有效按下并释放判超时失败；未开始或仍在蓄力时超时均失败。所有按钮外按下和未配对的释放不改变蓄力状态。","states":"准备→进行→成功/失败→结束。准备状态显示操作说明；首次有效按住进入进行状态，蓄力条持续增长并实时显示百分比；有效释放后根据力度进入成功或失败，pointercancel和超时也进入失败；结果卡片出现后调用一次宿主结束接口，由宿主显示约1秒反馈并恢复视频。","feedback":"成功时显示“力度适中：托球稳定，已完成合适蓄力。”，自绘篮球向上轻抛并带少量上举动效，结果卡片使用绿色。力度不足时显示“力度偏弱：释放过早，出手基础不足。”，使用橙色提示并让篮球轻微下坠。超过目标时显示“力度过猛：释放过晚，手臂失去平衡。”，使用红色提示并让篮球晃动。pointercancel显示“蓄力被中断，未能完成出手准备。”；超时显示“未在限时内完成蓄力。”。","timeout_s":8},"javascript":"function mount(container, api) {
  var root = document.createElement('div');
  root.id = 'game';
  root.setAttribute('role', 'application');
  root.setAttribute('aria-label', '蓄力托球');

  function make(tag, cls, text) {
    var node = document.createElement(tag);
    if (cls) node.className = cls;
    if (text !== undefined && text !== null) node.textContent = text;
    return node;
  }

  var hud = make('div', 'hud');
  var title = make('div', 'title', '蓄力托球');
  var goal = make('div', 'goal', '按住蓄力，在合适时机松开');
  var hint = make('div', 'hint', '按住底部按钮开始蓄力');
  hud.appendChild(title);
  hud.appendChild(goal);
  hud.appendChild(hint);

  var scene = make('div', 'scene');
  var player = make('div', 'player');
  var torso = make('div', 'torso');
  var leftArm = make('div', 'arm left-arm');
  var rightArm = make('div', 'arm right-arm');
  var hands = make('div', 'hands');
  var ball = make('div', 'ball', '球');
  hands.appendChild(leftArm);
  hands.appendChild(rightArm);
  player.appendChild(torso);
  player.appendChild(hands);
  player.appendChild(ball);
  scene.appendChild(player);

  var gaugeWrap = make('div', 'gauge-wrap');
  var gaugeLabel = make('div', 'gauge-label', '出手蓄力');
  var gauge = make('div', 'gauge');
  var targetBand = make('div', 'target-band');
  var fill = make('div', 'fill');
  var needle = make('div', 'needle');
  gauge.appendChild(targetBand);
  gauge.appendChild(fill);
  gauge.appendChild(needle);
  var gaugeValue = make('div', 'gauge-value', '0%');
  var scale = make('div', 'scale', '偏弱 0%                 65%—85% 理想区间                 过猛 100%');
  gaugeWrap.appendChild(gaugeLabel);
  gaugeWrap.appendChild(gauge);
  gaugeWrap.appendChild(gaugeValue);
  gaugeWrap.appendChild(scale);
  scene.appendChild(gaugeWrap);

  var controls = make('div', 'controls');
  var pad = make('button', 'charge-pad', '按住蓄力');
  pad.type = 'button';
  controls.appendChild(pad);

  var result = make('div', 'result');
  var resultTitle = make('div', 'result-title');
  var resultText = make('div', 'result-text');
  result.appendChild(resultTitle);
  result.appendChild(resultText);

  root.appendChild(hud);
  root.appendChild(scene);
  root.appendChild(controls);
  root.appendChild(result);
  container.appendChild(root);

  var state = 'ready';
  var activePointer = null;
  var chargeStart = 0;
  var rafId = 0;
  var timeoutId = null;
  var finishCalled = false;
  var CHARGE_DURATION = 2400;
  var TARGET_MIN = 65;
  var TARGET_MAX = 85;

  function setHint(text) {
    hint.textContent = text;
  }

  function updateGauge(percent) {
    var p = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, percent));
    fill.style.width = p + '%';
    needle.style.left = p + '%';
    gaugeValue.textContent = Math.round(p) + '%';
  }

  function animateCharge(now) {
    if (state !== 'playing' || activePointer === null) return;
    var percent = Math.min(100, ((now - chargeStart) / CHARGE_DURATION) * 100);
    updateGauge(percent);
    if (percent < 100) {
      rafId = window.requestAnimationFrame(animateCharge);
    }
  }

  function reportError(message) {
    if (api && typeof api.reportError === 'function') api.reportError(message);
  }

  function finishGame(success, message, kind) {
    if (state === 'success' || state === 'failure' || finishCalled) return;
    state = success ? 'success' : 'failure';
    activePointer = null;
    if (rafId) {
      window.cancelAnimationFrame(rafId);
      rafId = 0;
    }
    if (timeoutId !== null) {
      window.clearTimeout(timeoutId);
      timeoutId = null;
    }
    root.classList.remove('charging');
    root.classList.add(state);
    pad.classList.remove('pressed');
    pad.disabled = true;
    if (kind === 'success') player.classList.add('launch');
    if (kind === 'weak') player.classList.add('weak');
    if (kind === 'over') player.classList.add('over');
    resultTitle.textContent = success ? '力度适中' : (kind === 'weak' ? '力度偏弱' : (kind === 'over' ? '力度过猛' : '蓄力中断'));
    resultText.textContent = message;
    result.classList.add('show');
    if (!finishCalled) {
      finishCalled = true;
      try {
        api.finish({ result: success ? 'success' : 'failure', message: message });
      } catch (error) {
        reportError('结束小游戏时发生错误：' + (error && error.message ? error.message : String(error)));
      }
    }
  }

  function releaseCharge(cancelled) {
    if (state !== 'playing' || activePointer === null) return;
    var elapsed = performance.now() - chargeStart;
    var percent = Math.min(100, (elapsed / CHARGE_DURATION) * 100);
    updateGauge(percent);
    activePointer = null;
    root.classList.remove('charging');
    pad.classList.remove('pressed');
    if (cancelled) {
      finishGame(false, '蓄力被中断，未能完成出手准备。', 'cancel');
    } else if (percent >= TARGET_MIN && percent <= TARGET_MAX) {
      finishGame(true, '力度适中：托球稳定，已完成合适蓄力。', 'success');
    } else if (percent < TARGET_MIN) {
      finishGame(false, '力度偏弱：释放过早，出手基础不足。', 'weak');
    } else {
      finishGame(false, '力度过猛：释放过晚，手臂失去平衡。', 'over');
    }
  }

  function onPointerDown(event) {
    if (state === 'success' || state === 'failure') return;
    if (event.target !== pad && !pad.contains(event.target)) {
      setHint('请按住底部蓄力按钮');
      return;
    }
    if (activePointer !== null) return;
    event.preventDefault();
    activePointer = event.pointerId;
    chargeStart = performance.now();
    state = 'playing';
    root.classList.add('charging');
    pad.classList.add('pressed');
    setHint('保持按住，观察蓄力条进入绿色区间');
    updateGauge(0);
    try { pad.setPointerCapture(event.pointerId); } catch (error) { /* 捕获失败时仍监听根节点释放 */ }
    rafId = window.requestAnimationFrame(animateCharge);
  }

  function onPointerUp(event) {
    if (activePointer === null || event.pointerId !== activePointer) return;
    event.preventDefault();
    releaseCharge(false);
  }

  function onPointerCancel(event) {
    if (activePointer === null || event.pointerId !== activePointer) return;
    event.preventDefault();
    releaseCharge(true);
  }

  function onContextMenu(event) {
    event.preventDefault();
  }

  root.addEventListener('pointerdown', onPointerDown);
  root.addEventListener('pointerup', onPointerUp);
  root.addEventListener('pointercancel', onPointerCancel);
  root.addEventListener('contextmenu', onContextMenu);

  timeoutId = window.setTimeout(function () {
    if (state === 'ready' || state === 'playing') {
      finishGame(false, '未在限时内完成蓄力。', 'timeout');
    }
  }, 8000);

  return {
    destroy: function () {
      if (rafId) window.cancelAnimationFrame(rafId);
      if (timeoutId !== null) window.clearTimeout(timeoutId);
      root.removeEventListener('pointerdown', onPointerDown);
      root.removeEventListener('pointerup', onPointerUp);
      root.removeEventListener('pointercancel', onPointerCancel);
      root.removeEventListener('contextmenu', onContextMenu);
      if (root.parentNode) root.parentNode.removeChild(root);
    }
  };
}","css":"#game { position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; width: 100%; min-height: 280px; height: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; overflow: hidden; color: #ffffff; background: transparent; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; user-select: none; -webkit-user-select: none; touch-action: none; }
#game * { box-sizing: border-box; }
#game .hud { flex: 0 0 auto; padding: 10px 14px 8px; background: rgba(12, 24, 48, 0.72); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); }
#game .title { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; }
#game .goal { margin-top: 3px; color: #d9e7ff; font-size: 12px; }
#game .hint { min-height: 16px; margin-top: 5px; color: #ffd66b; font-size: 12px; }
#game .scene { position: relative; flex: 1 1 auto; min-height: 150px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 10px 14px 8px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(30, 65, 120, 0.42), rgba(8, 18, 38, 0.28)); }
#game .player { position: relative; width: 150px; height: 86px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
#game .torso { position: absolute; left: 49px; bottom: 0; width: 52px; height: 48px; border-radius: 24px 24px 8px 8px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2f75d1, #17468e); border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.58); }
#game .torso::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 13px; top: -21px; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; background: #e8b48d; border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.5); }
#game .hands { position: absolute; left: 20px; top: 16px; width: 110px; height: 32px; }
#game .arm { position: absolute; top: 9px; width: 43px; height: 11px; border-radius: 9px; background: #e8b48d; transform-origin: 10px 50%; }
#game .left-arm { left: 10px; transform: rotate(24deg); }
#game .right-arm { right: 10px; transform: rotate(-24deg); }
#game .ball { position: absolute; left: 61px; top: -4px; width: 31px; height: 31px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 50%; color: #5b2d12; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; background: radial-gradient(circle at 34% 28%, #ffd783 0 12%, transparent 13%), #e7832e; border: 2px solid #7b3d18; box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
#game .gauge-wrap { width: min(92%, 430px); }
#game .gauge-label { margin-bottom: 5px; text-align: center; color: #e8f0ff; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
#game .gauge { position: relative; height: 22px; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.16); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35); }
#game .target-band { position: absolute; left: 65%; top: 0; width: 20%; height: 100%; background: rgba(70, 220, 125, 0.55); border-left: 1px solid #b9ffd0; border-right: 1px solid #b9ffd0; z-index: 1; }
#game .fill { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 0; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4b9cff, #ffd45f 72%, #ff6d55); border-radius: 12px; }
#game .needle { position: absolute; top: -3px; left: 0; width: 3px; height: 28px; transform: translateX(-50%); background: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 0 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.6); z-index: 2; }
#game .gauge-value { margin-top: 4px; text-align: center; color: #ffffff; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; }
#game .scale { margin-top: 2px; color: #b9c9e2; font-size: 10px; text-align: center; white-space: nowrap; }
#game .controls { flex: 0 0 auto; padding: 9px 14px 13px; background: rgba(12, 24, 48, 0.72); border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); }
#game .charge-pad { width: 100%; min-height: 46px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.5); border-radius: 10px; color: #ffffff; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #337bd4, #1c4d9a); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1px; cursor: pointer; touch-action: none; }
#game .charge-pad.pressed { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #e1a42e, #b96b17); transform: translateY(1px); }
#game .charge-pad:disabled { opacity: 0.72; cursor: default; }
#game .result { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 48%; width: min(88%, 340px); padding: 14px 16px; display: none; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); text-align: center; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.48); border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(11, 24, 48, 0.94); box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); pointer-events: none; z-index: 5; }
#game .result.show { display: block; }
#game .result-title { color: #ffd66b; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; }
#game .result-text { margin-top: 6px; color: #ffffff; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; }
#game.success .result { border-color: rgba(90, 235, 145, 0.9); }
#game.success .result-title { color: #71ef9b; }
#game.failure .result { border-color: rgba(255, 120, 105, 0.9); }
#game.failure .result-title { color: #ff8b78; }
#game .player.launch .ball { animation: game-ball-launch 700ms ease-out forwards; }
#game .player.weak .ball { animation: game-ball-weak 550ms ease-in forwards; }
#game .player.over .ball { animation: game-ball-over 600ms ease-in-out forwards; }
@keyframes game-ball-launch { 0% { transform: translate(0,0) scale(1); } 65% { transform: translate(2px,-45px) scale(1.08); } 100% { transform: translate(8px,-58px) scale(0.9); opacity: 0.75; } }
@keyframes game-ball-weak { 0% { transform: translate(0,0); } 100% { transform: translate(0,18px) scale(0.8); opacity: 0.65; } }
@keyframes game-ball-over { 0% { transform: translate(0,0) rotate(0); } 45% { transform: translate(-7px,-18px) rotate(-18deg); } 100% { transform: translate(8px,10px) rotate(25deg); opacity: 0.6; } }
@media (max-height: 360px) { #game .player { transform: scale(0.78); margin-bottom: -8px; } #game .scene { padding-top: 3px; padding-bottom: 3px; } #game .gauge-wrap { transform: scale(0.9); transform-origin: center; } }"}

